# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Betting Intelligence — Environment Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# The dashboard works without any API keys — it loads cached data.
# For live odds, sign up at https://the-odds-api.com/ (free tier: 500 req/month).
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── TheOddsAPI Keys (optional — for live odds) ──────────────────────────
# Sign up: https://the-odds-api.com/
# Free tier: 500 requests/month, covers NBA lines
ODDS_API_KEY=your-api-key-here
ODDS_API_KEY_FALLBACK=

# ── Dashboard API Key (optional — for API access) ───────────────────────
API_KEY=change-me-to-a-random-secret
